{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Vilebranch Beastlance: melee auto attacks proc the CoA pet's attack speed buff",
  "contract": [
    "Expected values come from the item tooltips (CoA Tavern, SUB/db.exil.es 2026-10-04, AscensionDB WDB 2026-09-04) and the client Spell.dbc, not from the implementation. Each check runs for the CoA pet classes Primalist (spirit beast), Witch Hunter (Houndmaster spec, Shadowhound) and Tinker (Mechano-Bear).",
    "Tooltip: 'Your melee attacks have a 33% chance to increase your pets attack speed by 15% for 12 sec. (35sec. internal",
    "cooldown)'. Base 515714 procs at its DBC ProcChance 15%. Each equip aura is PROC_TRIGGER_SPELL with DBC ProcFlags 0, so it",
    "needs a melee spell_proc row. The proc decision must pass at the chance, and a real swing proc must put 313296 on the pet.",
    "Witch Hunters have no Polearms proficiency on CoA, so this polearm runs for Primalist and Tinker."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 400000,
